<h2 style="color: #1A1A1A; margin-top: 0;">Your booking was released</h2>

<p>Dear {{customerName}},</p>

<div class="info-box" style="border-left-color: #cc0000;">
  <p><span class="label">Booking:</span> {{rentalNumber}}</p>
  {{#if productName}}
  <p><span class="label">Item:</span> {{productName}}</p>
  {{/if}}
  <p>{{message}}</p>
</div>

{{#if moneyHeld}}
<p>The booking has been cancelled and the item is available to other customers again. The amount you paid has <strong>not</strong> been forfeited: it is held for refund, and our team will contact you about it.</p>
{{else}}
<p>The booking has been cancelled and the item is available to other customers again. No payment was received for this booking.</p>
{{/if}}

<p>If you still want to rent this item, you are welcome to send a new booking request.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{storeUrl}}/account/rentals" class="btn-primary">My rentals</a>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>

<p>
  Best regards,<br />
  <strong style="color: #D4AF37;">{{businessName}} Team</strong>
</p>
